## Copy this file to .env.local for the local demo.
## Local demo defaults for the README walkthrough.
## npm start also reads this file for the production-style handoff rehearsal.
## Seeded accounts:
## - demo / demo123 / demo@authmini.dev
## - guest / guest123 / guest@authmini.dev
## Canonical presentation flow: /login -> /signup -> /profile
JWT_SECRET=dev-secret-change-before-production
## Optional: uncomment to move the local demo user store.
## Relative paths resolve from the project root on every platform.
# AUTH_USER_STORE_FILE=./data/users.json
